<section id="help" class="lux-section lux-section--process">
  <div class="orb orb-a help-orb"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-label">My Process</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">How I Can Help <em>Your Brand</em></h2>
    <p class="help-intro">Every brand has a story, but not every brand knows how to communicate it effectively online. My role is to transform your ideas into clear strategy, engaging content, and stronger digital visibility.</p>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-index">
          <span class="step-index-label">Step</span>
          <span class="step-num">01</span>
        </div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <h3>Understanding Your Brand</h3>
          <p>The first step is understanding your brand identity, goals, and audience. I analyze your current digital presence, identify opportunities for improvement, and define a direction that aligns with your brand's vision and communication style.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-index">
          <span class="step-index-label">Step</span>
          <span class="step-num">02</span>
        </div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <h3>Building the Right Strategy</h3>
          <p>Once the direction is clear, I design a structured approach that includes content planning, visual storytelling, and formats that capture attention. The goal is to create content that people want to watch, engage with, and share.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-index">
          <span class="step-index-label">Step</span>
          <span class="step-num">03</span>
        </div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <h3>Creating, Publishing &amp; Improving</h3>
          <p>From production to publishing, I transform the strategy into real content through video, photography, editing, and digital storytelling. Your digital presence evolves from limited reach to stronger visibility and broader audience discovery.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
